ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098840/extras/17c002dff150a3f1d52d5e2355cccaf2.poster.avif?t=1749061902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098840/extras/17c002dff150a3f1d52d5e2355cccaf2.webm?t=1749061902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098840/extras/17c002dff150a3f1d52d5e2355cccaf2.mp4?t=1749061902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lead an army of stone warriors, transfer units and distribute available resources for successful defense against enemy attacks!<br></li><li>Use the tactical advantages of a variety of locations with their own unique atmosphere.<br></li><li>Different types of warriors with their own abilities.<br></li><li>Build defensive walls, place heavy weapons and traps, think over the course of the battle!<br></li><li>Gather troops to storm the enemy and improve your warriors, do everything to protect your kingdom!</li></ul>",
